  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 14436339712
    m_Localized: "Henry is a young man who works as a handyman in a city flooded
      by crime. \nEvery day he attends one of his clients\u2019 houses to fix something.
      His life is a constant routine: he goes to work, gets paid, buys something
      to improve his craft, and returns home. \nBut Henry has a gentle heart and
      a wild and clever mind, and he\u2019d love to see his city thrive.  \n\nToday
      he\u2019s attending an annual mandatory plumbing workshop at the National University
      of Repairmanshift that he needs to fulfill in order to keep his license. Everything
      seems to be quite boring, as usual\u2026 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
